  "Question": "The corresponding values of $x$ and $y$ are as follows: $x$ takes the values 1, 2, 3, 3 in order, and $y$ takes the values 2, 4, 6, 7 in order (the values of $x$ and $y$ are paired in order). Is $y$ a function of $x$?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "No, because $y$ has two values when $x=3$.",
    "B": "Yes, because every value of $x$ has a corresponding value of $y$.",
    "C": "Yes, because $y$ increases as $x$ increases.",
    "D": "Cannot be determined."
  },
  "Correct Answer": "A",
